###create product with promotional offer
POST http://localhost:8000/api/product/create/:userId
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "name": "Promotional Product",
  "description": "Product with special offer",
  "category": "categoryId",
  "price": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "quantity": 50,
  "takeInMethod": true,
  "isPromotionalOffer": true,
  "promotionalPrice": 75,
  "promotionalStartDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "promotionalEndDate": "2024-01-31T23:59:59Z",
  "promotionalDescription": "New Year Special - 25% off!"
}

###

###update product with promotional offer
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/product/:productId/:userId
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "isPromotionalOffer": true,
  "promotionalPrice": 75,
  "promotionalStartDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "promotionalEndDate": "2024-01-31T23:59:59Z",
  "promotionalDescription": "Extended offer!"
}

